<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - D. Witter cuts three banks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - D. Witter cuts three banks.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter Reynolds cut its rating on Fleet Financial Group Inc and Signet Banking Corp to accumulate from buy and Barnett Banks Inc to neutral from accumulate, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Fleet was down 3/4 at 51-1/8, Signet was down 1/8 at 28-7/8 and Barnett fell 1/2 to 39-3/4.</p>
